    "summary": "In Minimum-Cost Maximum Flow (MCMF) , every directed edge $e = (u, v)$ has both a capacity $c(e)$ and a per-unit shipping cost $w(e)$. We want to route the maximum possible flow $|f^*|$ from $s$ to $t$ at the minimum tot",
